rule refund_band v1
description "How large a refund is, by the items sent back: the band of the size the rule refund_size gives, which this rule applies"

enum band = small | large

inputs
  items : number  range >=1 <=60  fed by rulec "counter.rule" input items

outputs
  band : band

apply size_of = "size.rule" meaning:5c2879916cc8d613
  items = items
  size -> items_size

table band
policy unique
| items_size | -> band : band |
| few        | small          |
| many       | large          |

examples
| items | -> band |
| 20    | small   |
| 21    | large   |
